Fix failures seen running genconf.

The Gaudi plugin libraries load the common RecCaloCommon library.
Depending on the platform, however, when we ran genconf on the plugin
libraries, we could find the version from the release rather than the
one we just built.  If there were interface changes, that could result
in genconf failing.  Adjust the runtime LD_LIBRARY_PATH so that we
search the target directory for ReCCaloCommon first.

Similarly for the test environment.
